msgid "MINIGAME_NAME"
msgstr "Quick Draw"

msgid "MINIGAME_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Watch the signal light. While it is RED or yellow, do NOT press!\n\nWhen it turns GREEN, press the button as fast as you can. The fastest player of a round scores the most points. Pressing too early is a false start and you sit the round out. Watch out for fake yellow flashes! Six rounds, the last one counts double. Most points wins!"

msgid "MINIGAME_ACTION_JUMP"
msgstr "Jump"

msgid "MINIGAME_ACTION_PULL"
msgstr "Pull (press as fast as you can)"

msgid "MINIGAME_ACTION_PRESS"
msgstr "Press as soon as the light turns GREEN"
